  "_comment": [
    "Per-domain mail provider. THE DEFAULT IS NO CHANGE: a domain that is not",
    "listed here has its mail records left completely alone -- no MX, no SPF,",
    "no provider service records are created, changed or deleted for it.",
    "",
    "Listing a domain opts it in to enforcement, and a listed domain is on",
    "EXACTLY ONE provider: the other provider's MX/CNAME/SRV are removed so a",
    "zone never carries two MX sets splitting its inbound mail.",
    "",
    "MOVING a domain between providers additionally requires a typed",
    "confirmation at dispatch (106's confirm_mail_change, or",
    "-ConfirmMailProviderChange). Changing this file records the intent; it",
    "does not authorise the move on its own, and nothing here runs on a",
    "schedule.",
    "",
    "Entries below were generated from a live MX survey of every domain in",
    "sites_list.csv (2026-08-04) and match what each zone actually has, so",
    "enforcement is a no-op for all of them except any deliberate move.",
    "",
    "Valid values: 'microsoft365', 'google'. Omit a domain to leave it alone."
  ],
